{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Para Legends is a fast-paced third-person hero shooter inspired by the legacy of Paragon. Dive into thrilling team-based battles and choose from a growing cast of unique heroes\u2014each with distinct abilities, roles, and playstyles. From deadly marksmen to resilient tanks and supportive strategists, every legend brings something different to the fight.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game blends tight gunplay, powerful abilities, and fast movement to create dynamic and competitive multiplayer matches. Whether you\u2019re flanking enemies, holding the line, or supporting your team, Para Legends rewards skill, timing, and team coordination.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play with friends and have Fun!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3880430?t=1753524733","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3880430?t=1753524733","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3880430/c3f726b0b9e32ef9362b2c64474a4a740032bdbe/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1753524733","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3880430/c3f726b0b9e32ef9362b2c64474a4a740032bdbe/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1753524733","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"MMO","id":20},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Remote Play Together","id":44},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"Age Rating Justification (suitable for 12+):\r\nPara Legends features stylized third-person shooter gameplay with no graphic violence or gore. Combat is fast-paced and ability-driven, using colorful effects and non-realistic visuals. There is no blood, dismemberment, or mature language, making it appropriate for players aged 12 and up."},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Para Legends is a fast-paced third-person hero shooter inspired by the legacy of Paragon. Dive into thrilling team-based battles and choose from a growing cast of unique heroes\u2014each with distinct abilities, roles, and playstyles. From deadly marksmen to resilient tanks and supportive strategists, every legend brings something different to the fight.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game blends tight gunplay, powerful abilities, and fast movement to create dynamic and competitive multiplayer matches. Whether you\u2019re flanking enemies, holding the line, or supporting your team, Para Legends rewards skill, timing, and team coordination.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play with friends and have Fun!</p>","developers":["Dominik Sill"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Massively Multiplayer","id":"29"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3880430/190610651a975c2220cb82f58cd55bd219d55c3a/header.jpg?t=1753524733","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"name":"ParaLegends","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-2400 / AMD FX-6300<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GTX 660 / AMD Radeon HD 7870 (2 GB VRAM)<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 8 GB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Processor: Intel Core i5-8400 / AMD Ryzen 5 2600<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16